 offer their servic", "group": "Wellness and Healing Offerings", "sender": "Yuliya Pruzhanskaya", "sent_at": "2026-09-28T14:40:50+00:00", "contacts": []}]	\N	health-services-near-la-ecovilla	\N	2026-10-04 23:29:33.090414+00	2026-10-05 00:29:23.37+00	\N
