osta Rica. Your once-a-quarter trip to load up on essentials and occasional hard to find things. Good prices, large packages. Membership required, but 1 year will only cost $40 or so.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"956a1b09-b7e0-48c9-89c5-a6823e26ed91\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"3c42d91f-19a2-4aaf-a5e1-4b11297f9747\\",\\"type\\":\\"heading\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\",\\"level\\":3},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Local Supermarkets\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"5eebd78d-acd3-4f54-b731-94415bc389ee\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/BYGyvkFq44r9PX7R6\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Peri Orotina\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - local supermarket that actually has some decent selection of Gluten Free goods, decent chocolate and other things that you'd normally travel much further for.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"dab96ea4-f625-4249-830b-38732b6cf054\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/sdthGDdwmsfUQUa66\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Gran Bodega\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - another great local store with good produce section.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"70bde780-68d6-4cb0-a39e-402b2205dde1\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/g6e9JFmhwugsez4HA\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Los Miranda\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - bulk store with variety of produce\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"4060d5de-ae62-49c2-a462-fd4131d7da9b\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"8a7f72ea-7280-4cc4-b684-49ef7782e401\\",\\"type\\":\\"heading\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\",\\"level\\":3},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Healthy Food Stores\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"ceef73f8-e1ea-4a04-8da2-81299316d0d8\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/9EZJ9YEgF1KMuSoN8\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Love Organic Market & Kitchen\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - first ex-pat oriented store in San Mateo. All organic produce, a bit pricey.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"99d5abbf-c9c0-4fac-8444-6884785c1193\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/CSAZMgPAyHKp4Dg88\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Macrobiótica Vida Natural Atenas\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - closest health food store that will have a decent selection of product snot foundin Auto-Mercado\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"293d5c55-1726-4113-a256-ca1b7fb28d6a\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/XTeYk8QyjAxmXUxY7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Green Center Organic Super Market\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - this is the ultimate “Whole Foods” of Costa Rica. You will usually find almost everything here that you can’t in other stores. Yes, it’s pricey, and yes, it’s not quite Whole Foods :)\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"9f78e53a-d44d-4d66-9473-5f433d40515a\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/fX54XAhwJqoViGMp7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Nueces Industriales\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - Almonds, Walnuts, Cashews, Hazelnuts, etc. All kind of nuts in bulk quantities and excellent prices. Go here once every month or so and stock up on all your nutty needs.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"a60be0d4-5c51-4792-bc3a-840275b59da0\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.instagram.com/donluispanes/\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Don Luis Panes\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - Gluten Free bakery with excellent bread.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"23d1b126-51f3-4922-8813-beb963f8b2b4\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/WeaCct9fgQo88AZf6\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"EcoPlaza\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - Nice plaza with many eco-friendly stores and a couple of restaurants\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"543b0be2-eeeb-4b6f-a85c-afd9d82149a5\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/AbvoJJn24YYMiNo2A\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Cúrcuma\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - for all your spices needs, almost everything here you’ll need, though a bit pricey.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"77dc06d6-47ce-4105-876b-36380f9c327f\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://g.page/tramito?share\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"El Tramito a Granel Escazu\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - assortment of spices, salts, grains and everything you need to cook, bake, season and even eat at once is overwhelming. Great for buying things in bulk. They also do deliveries though “encomienda” on the buses.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"81343f68-dbf4-4664-a68a-63911a4f5283\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://befreecr.com/\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://befreecr.com/\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"underline\\":true}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" off