50e5ffa5-df40-438c-9c81-126a580070ac	test-27	Beaches	"[{\\"id\\":\\"6ff46c5a-871c-4f69-9c19-f50d5e525f3e\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/DemwqQxXo2PhkhC86\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Playa Tivives\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - raw beach with no infrastructure around it - nature at it’s purest.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"2824a08a-92a2-4a37-b1f1-971fb08e1f9f\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pros:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" long beach, big waves with a little bay that has calm water for kids to swim\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"866b23ba-45b9-4a40-85b5-63c9200810c3\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Cons:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" feels sort of “out there”, even though it’s not that far (this could be a pro)\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"9fa72b6f-76e1-46ad-a48d-cfe6999a110b\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pro Tip:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" visit here when you want to get away from it all\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"975cb11e-e215-469c-a65c-0caca1743fdc\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/psCWmYJvtjy62thP9\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Playa Pogeres aka “Vista Mar”\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - is the closest beach from San Mateo, about 35 minute drive and best of all, you’re driving on good paved roads only!\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"6445655a-082f-4802-be3a-ce69f03b4e35\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pros:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" close to road, no waves, makkah sightings, no people (on weekdays you can be the only one frequently), access to coconuts, good sunset viewing point\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"de2a6d68-c204-4b89-a3b7-d0f076376595\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Cons:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" close to road, sand quality is OKish\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"0bf0fa82-1a91-483f-a978-bf4695294aed\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pro Tip:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" park across from Vista Mar Restuarant\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"88f7eaf4-29a2-4817-a386-2f185d788132\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/ThN2rCt1VZbxrBdu6\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Playa Mantas\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - very scenic beach with a little white sand and the calmest water you’ll ever see on this coast as the beach is inside a small bay.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"d86d8e91-a40d-41e8-95dd-6ba2fc3e295e\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pros:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" calm water, scenic views, some white sand, showers\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"6b87bccb-b335-48df-a98d-ee00c67ea7e5\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Cons:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" paid parking only which can be full on weekend, gets busy on weekends\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"c0758b59-1c65-4292-b913-7fd7b97db3cb\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pro Tip:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" come here on weekdays\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"36fb361c-e18f-467a-a3ae-609ca579db56\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/oQ84LD4JvXg8BmA89\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Playa Herradura\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - very popular beach with great sand and smallish, but fun waves.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"05e3f9a5-54a0-45ff-b2f3-2bc85878136e\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pros:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" white sand, good water, great views\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"5af961c3-d9c0-4e71-a6b8-ddedafe773dd\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Cons:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" impossibly busy on weekends, avoid, but awesome on weekdays\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"8fec37af-1711-4716-a09c-a8eda4c9dca7\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pro Tip:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" drive as far left as you can to avoid people and then walk even further left\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"a9248b5a-88da-4c2f-968c-dacb2665e26d\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/VanMgovhEAVzJA9s7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Jaco Beach\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - the most popular beach in the area, packed with bars, restuarants and tourists.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"fe17d8b8-32e9-40b8-92e9-224ea899fc8f\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pros:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" big waves, great for surfing, good food options in town\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"3e6cae43-354a-4533-a4ef-6861a7f6d5a5\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Cons:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" touristy, beach itself doesn’t feel cozy\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"d0633a2c-db5f-4e6a-ac8d-a2295caed523\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pro Tip:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" avoid\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"bf70cddb-6cbb-486e-91a6-dba577d7f097\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/jj8X89D6ZTe92ChbA\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Playa Hermosa\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - beyond Jaco, more chill vibe, nice cafes, great surfing.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"26708a5b-5cd4-4c94-9089-5bcf05041b64\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/CnSXg4x6PNyxqa1WA\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"El Peñon de Guacalillo\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - not exactly a beach, but beautiful place to explore caves and sinset views\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"17d70092-fae9-4465-aaca-eb95a425dc88\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pros:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" Great views, big caves, unlike any other coast in the area\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"2e68985c-3ef5-4c81-858d-ea8a4b40028f\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Cons:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" a bit off the beaten path, therefore the path itself is a bit off (dirt road)\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"5253db35-2276-4710-a5bb-949c2fcdde57\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pro Tip:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" 4x4 preferrard, but doable with Sedan depending on season. Check tide tables for low tide to explore caves.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"0664feee-26b5-4486-bc6b-777aa295aa48\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]}]"	A page about test 27	2025-03-21 15:41:05.218123+00	2025-03-22 18:10:00.204+00	\N	f	Nature	0	'-1711':668 '-2276':1052 '-4710':1053 '-4716':669 '-5':918 '/jj8x89d6zte92chba':890 '/maps/cnsxg4x6pnyxqa1wa':935 '/maps/dem