osta Rica. Your once-a-quarter trip to load up on essentials and occasional hard to find things. Good prices, large packages. Membership required, but 1 year will only cost $40 or so.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"956a1b09-b7e0-48c9-89c5-a6823e26ed91\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"3c42d91f-19a2-4aaf-a5e1-4b11297f9747\\",\\"type\\":\\"heading\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\",\\"level\\":3},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Local Supermarkets\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"5eebd78d-acd3-4f54-b731-94415bc389ee\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/BYGyvkFq44r9PX7R6\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Peri Orotina\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - local supermarket that actually has some decent selection of Gluten Free goods, decent chocolate and other things that you'd normally travel much further for.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"dab96ea4-f625-4249-830b-38732b6cf054\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/sdthGDdwmsfUQUa66\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Gran Bodega\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - another great local store with good produce section.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"70bde780-68d6-4cb0-a39e-402b2205dde1\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\