50e5ffa5-df40-438c-9c81-126a580070ac	test-27	Beaches	"[{\\"id\\":\\"6ff46c5a-871c-4f69-9c19-f50d5e525f3e\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/DemwqQxXo2PhkhC86\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Playa Tivives\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - raw beach with no infrastructure around it - nature at it’s purest.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"2824a08a-92a2-4a37-b1f1-971fb08e1f9f\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pros:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" long beach, big waves with a little bay that has calm water for kids to swim\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"866b23ba-45b9-4a40-85b5-63c9200810c3\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Cons:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" feels sort of “out there”, even though it’s not that far (this could be a pro)\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"9fa72b6f-76e1-46ad-a48d-cfe6999a110b\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pro Tip:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" visit here when you want to get away from it all.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"975cb11e-e215-469c-a65c-0caca1743fdc\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/psCWmYJvtjy62thP9\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Playa Pogeres aka “Vista Mar”\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - is the closest beach from San Mateo, about 35 minute drive and best of all, you’re driving on good paved roads only!\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"6445655a-082f-4802-be3a-ce69f03b4e35\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pros:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" close to road, no waves, makkah sightings, no people (on weekdays you can be the only one frequently), access to coconuts, good sunset viewing point\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"de2a6d68-c204-4b89-a3b7-d0f076376595\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Cons:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" close to road, sand quality is OKish\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"0bf0fa82-1a91-483f-a978-bf4695294aed\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pro Tip:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" park across from Vista Mar Restuarant\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"88f7eaf4-29a2-4817-a386-2f185d788132\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/ThN2rCt1VZbxrBdu6\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Playa Mantas\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - very scenic beach with a little white sand and the calmest water you’ll ever see on this coast as the beach is inside a small bay.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"d86d8e91-a40d-41e8-95dd-6ba2fc3e295e\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pros:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" calm water, scenic views, some white sand, showers\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"6b87bccb-b335-48df-a98d-ee00c67ea7e5\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Cons:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" paid parking only which can be full on weekend, gets busy on weekends\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"c0758b59-1c65-4292-b913-7fd7b97db3cb\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Pro Tip:\\",\\"styles\\":{\\"bold\\":true}},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" come here on weekdays\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"36fb361c-e18f-467a-a3ae-609ca579db56\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/oQ84LD4JvXg8BmA89\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Playa Herradura\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]}