a941d69c-34d5-44e3-9d6d-e5b1a35599cb	food-stores	Food Stores & Farmers Markets	"[{\\"id\\":\\"bf6536ce-2e2b-41cf-89f8-2564640b9f97\\",\\"type\\":\\"heading\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\",\\"level\\":3},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Supermarkets\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"47a53caa-167c-4989-8d1e-743c38fa95cc\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/vmGtq92b97MXcAoq7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Auto Mercado - Plaza Herradura\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - this is the easiest one to drive to, takes about 40 minutes and avoids the main highway. You can also combine this easily with a beach stop.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"53ca0c94-8c92-4809-85c9-573792e4ebd4\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/U2Enpq2fQGsjtPFR7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Auto Mercado - Guácima\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - this is the closest one in San Jose area, it will have a very similar selection to the one in Herradura.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"39379688-744b-4446-882b-9992528b58dd\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/Zycub971F7NWUkBr8\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"PriceSmart\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - Costco of Costa Rica. Your once-a-quarter trip to load up on essentials and occasional hard to find things. Good prices, large packages. Membership required, but 1 year will only cost $40 or so.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"956a1b09-b7e0-48c9-89c5-a6823e26ed91\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"3c42d91f-19a2-4aaf-a5e1-4b11297f9747\\",\\"type\\":\\"heading\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\",\\"level\\":3},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Local Supermarkets\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"5eebd78d-acd3-4f54-b731-94415bc389ee\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/BYGyvkFq44r9PX7R6\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Peri Orotina\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - local supermarket that actually has some decent selection of Gluten Free goods, decent chocolate and other things that you'd normally travel much further for.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"dab96ea4-f625-4249-830b-38732b6cf054\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/sdthGDdwmsfUQUa66\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Gran Bodega\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - another great local store with good produce section.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"70bde780-68d6-4cb0-a39e-402b2205dde1\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/g6e9JFmhwugsez4HA\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Los Miranda\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - bulk store with variety of produce\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"4060d5de-ae62-49c2-a462-fd4131d7da9b\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"8a7f72ea-7280-4cc4-b684-49ef7782e401\\",\\"type\\":\\"heading\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\",\\"level\\":3},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Healthy Food Stores\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"ceef73f8-e1ea-4a04-8da2-81299316d0d8\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/9EZJ9YEgF1KMuSoN8\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Love Organic Market & Kitchen\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - first ex-pat oriented store in San Mateo. All organic produce, a bit pricey.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"99d5abbf-c9c0-4fac-8444-6884785c1193\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/CSAZMgPAyHKp4Dg88\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Macrobiótica Vida Natural Atenas\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - closest health food store that will have a decent selection of product snot foundin Auto-Mercado\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"293d5c55-1726-4113-a256-ca1b7fb28d6a\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/XTeYk8QyjAxmXUxY7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Green Center Organic Super Market\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - this is the ultimate “Whole Foods” of Costa Rica. You will usually find almost everything here that you can’t in other stores. Yes, it’s pricey, and yes, it’s not quite Whole Foods :)\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"9f78e53a-d44d-4d66-9473-5f433d40515a\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/fX54XAhwJqoViGMp7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Nueces Industriales\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - Almonds, Walnuts, Cashews, Hazelnuts, etc. All kind of nuts in bulk quantities and excellent prices. Go here once every month or so and stock up on all your nutty needs.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"a60be0d4-5c51-4792-bc3a-840275b59da0\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.instagram.com/donluispanes/\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Don Luis Panes\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - Gluten Free bakery with excellent bread.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"23d1b126-51f3-4922-8813-beb963f8b2b4\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"defau