a2f89f83-389c-465f-8d96-1e4ab90f3ff2	learning-spanish	Learning Spanish	"[{\\"id\\":\\"455f64c2-b271-4cf6-b317-2d737255cc73\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"We have local Spanish Teachers in the area - see Events and Services chat for latest offerings.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"0d815d50-277b-459e-880c-f451880cbc66\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"dfe34a0e-a95b-4648-a9fb-e39309a5de29\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Language Transfer Series is an alternative way to learn Spanish that many have found helpful: \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLeA5t3dWTWvvwf5fw0Nl7mVk0OUjP1Ln2\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLeA5t3dWTWvvwf5fw0Nl7mVk0OUjP1Ln2\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" \\\\nAlso available on Soundcloud since its Audio Only: \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.languagetransfer.org/free-courses-1\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://www.languagetransfer.org/free-courses-1\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"22efd933-90ca-40e7-9973-a1d9f083ed97\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"For passive / fun learning, the Dreaming Spanish video series is great to pick-up comprehension skills:\\\\n\\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.dreamingspanish.com/browse?level=superbeginner\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://www.dreamingspanish.com/browse?level=superbeginner\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" \\\\n\\\\nIn particular check out their methodology, especially if you struggle with traditional methods: \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.dreamingspanish.com/method\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://www.dreamingspanish.com/method\\\\n\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"1367bc81-7063-46f4-965c-dd5a8aebddb3\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"For 1-on-1 tutoring with real isntructors at very affordable rates: \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.italki.com/\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://www.italki.com/\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" or \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://preply.com/\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://preply.com/\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"ec1fc8f1-13de-41b9-8c75-c685ee4483ff\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Sentences \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show_all_in/spa/eng\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show_all_in/spa/eng\\\\n\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Which you can use for spaced repetition memorization via Anki: \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\