67a05dfb-c266-49fd-bd8e-297c7f3ce84d	housing	Housing	"[{\\"id\\":\\"e33335c2-4453-4961-846d-afaa05a4b6f1\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"There are two main ways to find local housing: \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://machucahomes.com/\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://machucahomes.com/\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" and MV Housing and Rentals WhatsApp Group.  \\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"fa587c1f-2845-4866-bc9d-1cf5727ec6d8\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"ef5817f7-6c9e-463f-ade9-5b3fe9d8e473\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"For tico-style houses which are often cheaper and sometimes just as nice, connect with <fill in>\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"a44dc496-f7ba-497f-8ec6-e5f8107cd70b\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]}]"	A page about Housing	2025-03-27 22:19:37.915962+00	2025-03-27 22:20:49.578+00	\N	f	Local Know-How	1	'-2845':57 '-4453':4 '-4866':58 '-4961':5 '-846':6 '1cf5727ec6d8':61 '463f':77 '497f':115 '5b3fe9d8e473':79 '6c9e':76 '8ec6':116 'a44dc496':113 'a44dc496-f7ba-497f-8ec6-e5f8107cd70b':112 'ade9':78 'afaa05a4b6f1':9 'backgroundcolor':15,67,85,123 'bc9d':60 'bc9d-1cf5727ec6d8':59 'cheaper':101 'children':54,72,110,128 'connect':107 'content':19,37,71,89,127 'd':8 'd-afaa05a4b6f1':7 'default':14,16,66,68,84,86