50e6a96c-c9c4-4496-9ca0-696fe1120ce5	car-buying	Car Buying	"[{\\"id\\":\\"f4bbd685-8b0f-43d9-a4ed-66ff23504fee\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"So as not to repeat the information already out there, take a look here for the basics:\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"dfd78d87-45e2-46ac-be35-13deb6fe768c\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.twoweeksincostarica.com/buying-a-car-in-costa-rica/\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://www.twoweeksincostarica.com/buying-a-car-in-costa-rica/\\\\n\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"fa328fef-4959-45e3-8f8d-7cb5b4e7a8f7\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"If you want to avoid doing the process yourself, there are services out there that will handle everything for you. They deal with reputable dealers and you reduce your chances of getting a lemon. This is especially important in used cars market, because you will almost always have some sort of issues with used cars, the only question is the magnitude of those issues.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"fe25cf28-d48a-4dcd-8e29-ea6ef1efbfb8\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"\\\\nHere is one such service: \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://wheelscr.com/\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://wheelscr.com/\\\\n\\",\\"